# GROOVE's STYLE (ALGO): BREAKS, AMEN on white 7
# GROOVE (the drums as EZdrummer): white 1-15 grooves (INTRO VERSE CHORUS BRIDGE OUTRO x3), white 16 the end, black fills.
# Stopped it plays on its own clock; playing, a new groove waits for the bar; a fill runs to the bar's end, then the groove.
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
tapkey w5
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect track 5
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
seqtype 2
wait 100
expect seq 7
tap SEQ
wait 100
turn ALGO 1
wait 200
expect grstyle 1
tapkey w6
wait 1500
shot groove_breaks.png
tapkey w6
wait 100
turn ALGO -1
wait 100
expect grstyle 0
